 they thought they would camp but then changed their minds and not having any reservations, they were forced to stay at the only hotel with available rooms. The Packwood Inn. Dirty, dirty, dirty, and lets not forget the horrible service. ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"di9p6","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":" ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"85lvu","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"The Cowlitz River Lodge ","decorations":[{"type":"BOLD","fontWeightValue":700},{"type":"COLOR","colorData":{"foreground":"#0957a2"}},{"type":"LINK","linkData":{"link":{"url":"whitepasstravel.com/cowlitzriverlodge/","target":"BLANK"}}}]}},{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"has large very clean rooms, a large dining area with hot food for breakfast included and they offer a 2 glass per person complimentary wine tasting for each guest from 6-9 pm each evening. What a deal! Worth every penny by comparison. ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"5p0kf","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":" ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"GALLERY","id":"18v23","nodes":[],"galleryData":{"containerData":{"width":{"size":"CONTENT"},"alignment":"CENTER","textWrap":true},"items":[{"image":{"media":{"src":{"url":"577c92_937d9f2dc5c5447d888c74011dd203d3~mv2_d_4160_3120_s_4_2.jpg"},"width":4160,"height":3120}},"title":"Elk"},{"image":{"media":{"src":{"url":"577c92_bb14279a1aa344f3b23118cc90803ee6~mv2_d_4032_3024_s_4_2.jpg"},"width":4032,"height":3024}},"title":"Cowlitz River Lodge"},{"image":{"media":{"src":{"url":"577c92_5765b0438a044f9c80c72a3e140dc03e~mv2_d_4032_3024_s_4_2.jpg"},"width":4032,"height":3024}},"title":"Cowlitz River Lodge"},{"image":{"media":{"src":{"url":"577c92_022c8a5f115546cf804a69783dfa5c1d~mv2_d_4032_3024_s_4_2.jpg"},"width":4032,"height":3024}},"title":"Cowlitz River Lodge"},{"image":{"media":{"src":{"url":"577c92_018ab9603ff2468296d473c134000041~mv2.jpg"},"width":1500,"height":1125}},"title":"Cowlitz River Lodge"},{"image":{"media":{"src":{"url":"577c92_6048767565e84021aed631216c20cb5c~mv2_d_4032_3024_s_4_2.jpg"},"width":4032,"height":3024}},"title":"Cowlitz River Lodge"},{"image":{"media":{"src":{"url":"577c92_428bd4f14ea0443fa54e6b8843bda4e6~mv2_d_4032_3024_s_4_2.jpg"},"width":4032,"height":3024}},"title":"Cowlitz River Lodge"},{"image":{"media":{"src":{"url":"577c92_e4eca734dd4c439ab0bdcad707c1b575~mv2_d_4032_3024_s_4_2.jpg"},"width":4032,"height":3024}},"title":"Melisa Smith"}],"options":{"layout":{"type":"GRID","horizontalScroll":false,"orientation":"ROWS","numberOfColumns":2},"item":{"targetSize":300,"ratio":1,"crop":"FILL","spacing":10},"thumbnails":{"placement":"BOTTOM","spacing":0}}}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"br4v1","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":" ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"4inbn","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":" ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"2ihkt","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":" ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"7q7p6","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"We departed Packwood on the last leg of our journey around 8:30 AM. I think that was our departure time most mornings on the WABDR and it worked out fairly well all along the route.","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARA